It includes:
- Verses from Bhartṛhari's Nītiśataka and Kulaśekhara's Mukundamālā, from GRETIL e-texts as published by
  the Ambuda project (https://github.com/ambuda-org/texts), CC BY-NC-SA 4.0.
- Verb and noun forms generated with Vidyut (https://github.com/ambuda-org/vidyut), MIT License.
- 49 stories (Sanskrit and English) from the class notes "लघुसंस्कृतकथाः – Short Sanskrit Stories, Part 2" (2021),
  published here with Ashwin's permission. OCR transcription with corrections by Claude; minor typos corrected.
  Story 1.50 of the notes is excluded because its text comes from a published textbook.
- Other text, translations and stories written by Claude (AI) for Ashwin; not yet checked by a teacher.
